   "text": "La Trobe University (Sydney Campus) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLa Trobe University (Sydney Campus)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nStudy at one of Australia’s leading universities in our new state-of-the-art campus, officially opened in 2017.  Located in the centre of the city’s business precinct, the Campus is close to part-time work and internship opportunities, and is just minutes’ walk away from major transport hubs, shopping centres, vibrant café districts and the city's world-renowned icons.\nWith just under 1000 students, the Sydney Campus offers a friendly and supportive community for you to learn and make friends. Our students originate from more than 30 countries and contribute to a rich, multicultural education experience.\nThe Sydney Campus offers foundation studies and diploma programs, along with a range of undergraduate and postgraduate degrees in the areas of Business, Information Technology, Cybersecurity, and Education.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:03\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:24\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$45,000.00\nMin: A$36,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n35%\n350 of 1,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n2017\nCampus(es)\nSydney\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.latrobe.edu.au/international/student-life/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.latrobe.edu.au/international/applying/fees\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/latrobeuniaustralia\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.latrobe.edu.au/international/study/industry-employment\nAdditional Information\n-",
